# BUGS

There are no other calendar functions: no `localtime`, `gmtime`, `mktime`, `clock`, `difftime`, `sleep`, `usleep` or `timespec_get`; nothing fills a `struct tm` but the program.
The four monotonic clocks are not distinguished.
